  "categorias": "Deportes|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>La ma&ntilde;ana de este mi&eacute;rcoles se ha iniciado en la pista polideportiva del Arrabal del Castillo de Onda la actividad de zumba que se desarrollar&aacute; tambi&eacute;n lunes y viernes, a partir de las 9.30 horas.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/09/IMG_0529.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Est&aacute; dirigida por la instructora de Onda Beatriz Juan Garc&iacute;a y para participar es tan f&aacute;cil como ir all&iacute;, junto a la antigua f&aacute;brica de La Campaneta, a la hora del inicio de las sesiones. La idea es continuar al aire libre mientras la climatolog&iacute;a lo permita. Despu&eacute;s pasar&iacute;an al local adjunto de la Asociaci&oacute;n de Vecinos del Arrabal del Castillo o buscar&iacute;an un bajo m&aacute;s grande si participaran m&aacute;s personas.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zumbaravalcastell/img_0527.jpg\" alt=\"img_0527\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zumbaravalcastell/img_0529.jpg\" alt=\"img_0529\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zumbaravalcastell/img_0530.jpg\" alt=\"img_0530\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zumbaravalcastell/img_0531.jpg\" alt=\"img_0531\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zumbaravalcastell/img_0534.jpg\" alt=\"img_0534\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zumbaravalcastell/img_0535.jpg\" alt=\"img_0535\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zumbaravalcastell/img_0536.jpg\" alt=\"img_0536\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zumbaravalcastell/img_0537.jpg\" alt=\"img_0537\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zumbaravalcastell/img_0538.jpg\" alt=\"img_0538\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zumbaravalcastell/img_0539.jpg\" alt=\"img_0539\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zumbaravalcastell/img_0540.jpg\" alt=\"img_0540\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
